{"strongs": "H0905", "word": "בַּד", "translit": "bad", "root": "אתת", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "separation", "definition": "II. בַּד , בָּ֑ד noun masculine separation , concrete part ( , portion ) — suffix (always with לְ ) לְבַדִּי , לְבַדּוֺ etc., 3 feminine plural Gen 21:28 לְבַדְּהֶן , v Gen 21:29 לְבַדָּ֫נָה ; — 1. with לְ , only in singular, לְבַד properly in a state of (see below לְ ) separation, alone, by itself (French à part ). \\ \\ a. Exod 26:9 (= Exod 36:16 ) five curtains לְבַד by themselves , and six curtains לְבַד by themselves , Judg 7:5 him shalt thou set לבד apart , Zech 12:12-14 . \\ \\ b. with suffix (89 t.) to express the idea of by oneself, alone (properly in his, thy, my separation ), Gen 2:18 it is not good for man to be לְבַדּוֺ alone , Gen 21:28 and A. set the seven lambs לְבַדְּהֶן by themselves (literally in their separation), Gen 32:17 ; Gen 43:32 ; 2Sam 10:8 ; Isa 5:8 ; Gen 42:38 הוּא לְבַדּוֺ he alone , Exod 18:14 אַתָּה לְבַדְּךָ thou alone , Num 11:14 אָנֹכִי לְבַדִּי I alone , 1Kgs 19:10 ; 1Kgs 19:14 ; Deut 8:3 not upon bread alone , Deut 29:13 ; 2Sam 13:32 ; 2Sam 18:24 ; Isa 44:24 ; Isa 49:21 ; Isa 63:3 +; after an oblique case, as a dative Exod 22:19 ; Judg 3:20 ; Ps 51:6 לְךָ לְבַדְּךָ against thee alone have I sinned; a genitive Ps 71:16 I will make mention of צִדְקָֽתְךָ לְבֶַדּךָ׃ the righteousness of thee alone . \\ \\ c. as adverb of limitation, Isa 26:13 only through thee do we celebrate thy name, Eccl 7:29 . \\ \\ d. followed by מִן it becomes a preposition, apart from, besides , Exod 12:37 ; Num 29:39 ; Deut 3:5 ; Deut 18:8 (read מִמְּכָרָיו with ᵐ5 ᵑ6 ᵑ7 Aq Ew Di ) Judg 8:26 ; Judg 20:15 and elsewhere (15 t.); once, Ezra 1:6 , with עַל instead of מִן . \\ \\ e. מִלְּבַד 33 (probably inverted for לְבַד מִן besides ) (chiefly P and late): Gen 26:1 ; Gen 46:26 ; Lev 9:17 ; Lev 23:38 (4 t.) Num 5:8 ; Num 6:21 ; Num 17:14 + 12 t. 28-29; Deut 28:69 ; Josh 22:29 ; 1Kgs 10:13 ; 1Chr 3:9 ; 2Chr 9:12 ; 2Chr 17:19 ; 2Chr 31:16 ; Ezra 2:65 = Neh 7:67 ; Dan 11:4 . With suffix Deut 4:35 אֵין עוֺד מִלְּבַדּוֺ there is none else besides him (compare מִבַּלְעָדַי Isa 45:21 ). 2. concrete part Exod 30:34 ( P ) בַּד בְּבַד יִהְיֶה part for (i.e. like; compare בְּ III. 3. end) part shall it be. 3. בַּדִּים parts , specifically extended from something , i.e. \\ \\ \\ ( a ) of a body, members, limbs Job 18:13 (of man), Job 41:4 (of crocodile); \\ \\ \\ ( b ) of a vine, rods or shoots Ezek 17:6 ; Ezek 19:14 \\ \\ \\ ( c ) of poles or staves used for carrying the ark Exod 25:13 ; Exod 25:14 ; Exod 25:15 ; Exod 35:12 ; Exod 37:4 ; Exod 37:5 ; Exod 39:35 ; Exod 40:20 ; Num 4:6 ; 1Kgs 8:7 ; 1Kgs 8:8 (twice in verse) (= 2Chr 5:8 ; 2Chr 5:9 (twice in verse)), or table of shewbread Exod 25:27 ; Exod 25:28 ; Exod 35:13 ; Exod 37:14 ; Exod 37:15 ; Num 4:8 , or altar of B. O. Exod 27:6 (twice in verse); Exod 27:7 (twice in verse); Exod 35:16 ; Exod 38:5 ; Exod 38:6 ; Exod 38:7 ; Exod 39:39 ; Num 4:14 , or altar of incense Exod 30:4 ; Exod 30:5 ; Exod 35:15 ; Exod 37:27 ; Exod 37:28 ; Num 4:11 \\ \\ \\ ( d ) more generally bars (of fortress) Hos 11:6 , (of a gate) Job 17:16 figurative בַּדֵּי שְׁאֹל (see Isa 38:10 ). ** Job 17:16 read הַעִמָּדִי (for בַּדֵּי ) ᵐ5 Du Dr, with נֵחָ֑ת in v b (for נָחַ֑ת ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB913')\">BDB913</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H905')\">H905</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB912')\">BDB912</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB914')\">BDB914</entry></div><p> II. <bdbheb>בַּד</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בָּ֑ד</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>separation</highlightword>, concrete part (<placeholder502/>, <highlight>portion</highlight>) — suffix (always with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>) <bdbheb>לְבַדִּי</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>לְבַדּוֺ</bdbheb> etc., 3 feminine plural <ref ref=\"Gen 21:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,28)\">Gen 21:28</ref> <bdbheb>לְבַדְּהֶן</bdbheb>, v<ref ref=\"Gen 21:29\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,29)\">Gen 21:29</ref> <bdbheb>לְבַדָּ֫נָה</bdbheb>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> with <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>, only in singular, <bdbheb>לְבַד</bdbheb> properly <highlight>in a state of</highlight> (see below <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb>) <highlight>separation, alone, by itself</highlight> (French <highlight>à part</highlight>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"Exod 26:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,26,9)\">Exod 26:9</ref> (= <ref ref=\"Exod 36:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,36,16)\">Exod 36:16</ref>) five curtains <bdbheb>לְבַד</bdbheb> <highlight>by themselves</highlight>, and six curtains <bdbheb>לְבַד</bdbheb> <highlight>by themselves</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Judg 7:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,5)\">Judg 7:5</ref> him shalt thou set <bdbheb>לבד</bdbheb> <highlight>apart</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Zech 12:12-14\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(38,12,12)\">Zech 12:12-14</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> with suffix (89 t.) to express the idea of <highlight>by oneself, alone</highlight> (properly <highlight>in his, thy, my separation</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Gen 2:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,2,18)\">Gen 2:18</ref> it is not good for man to be <bdbheb>לְבַדּוֺ</bdbheb> <highlight>alone</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Gen 21:28\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(1,21,28)\">Gen 21:28</ref> and A. set the seven lambs <bdbheb>לְבַדְּהֶן</bdbheb> <highlight>by themselves</highlight> (literally in their separation), <ref ref=\"Gen 32:17\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,17)\">Gen 32:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 43:32\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(1,43,32)\">Gen 43:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 10:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,10,8)\">2Sam 10:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 5:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,8)\">Isa 5:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 42:38\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(1,42,38)\">Gen 42:38</ref> <bdbheb>הוּא לְבַדּוֺ</bdbheb> he <highlight>alone</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Exod 18:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,18,14)\">Exod 18:14</ref> <bdbheb>אַתָּה לְבַדְּךָ</bdbheb> thou <highlight>alone</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Num 11:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,11,14)\">Num 11:14</ref> <bdbheb>אָנֹכִי לְבַדִּי</bdbheb> I <highlight>alone</highlight>, <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:10\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,10)\">1Kgs 19:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,14)\">1Kgs 19:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 8:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,3)\">Deut 8:3</ref> not upon bread <highlight>alone</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Deut 29:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,29,13)\">Deut 29:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:32\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,32)\">2Sam 13:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 18:24\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(10,18,24)\">2Sam 18:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 44:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,44,24)\">Isa 44:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 49:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,21)\">Isa 49:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 63:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,3)\">Isa 63:3</ref> +; after an oblique case, as a dative <ref ref=\"Exod 22:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,19)\">Exod 22:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 3:20\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,20)\">Judg 3:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 51:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,51,6)\">Ps 51:6</ref> <bdbheb>לְךָ לְבַדְּךָ</bdbheb> against thee <highlight>alone</highlight> have I sinned; a genitive <ref ref=\"Ps 71:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,16)\">Ps 71:16</ref> I will make mention of <bdbheb>צִדְקָֽתְךָ לְבֶַדּךָ׃</bdbheb> the righteousness of thee <highlight>alone</highlight>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> as adverb of limitation, <ref ref=\"Isa 26:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,13)\">Isa 26:13</ref> <highlight>only</highlight> through thee do we celebrate thy name, <ref ref=\"Eccl 7:29\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(21,7,29)\">Eccl 7:29</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> followed by <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb> it becomes a preposition, <highlight>apart from, besides</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Exod 12:37\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(2,12,37)\">Exod 12:37</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 29:39\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(4,29,39)\">Num 29:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 3:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,5)\">Deut 3:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 18:8\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(5,18,8)\">Deut 18:8</ref> (read <bdbheb>מִמְּכָרָיו</bdbheb> with <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Syr')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ6</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Aq')\"><reflink>Aq</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>) <ref ref=\"Judg 8:26\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,26)\">Judg 8:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,15)\">Judg 20:15</ref> and elsewhere (15 t.); once, <ref ref=\"Ezra 1:6\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(15,1,6)\">Ezra 1:6</ref>, with <bdbheb>עַל</bdbheb> instead of <bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <bdbheb>מִלְּבַד</bdbheb><sub>33</sub> (probably inverted for <bdbheb>לְבַד מִן</bdbheb> <highlight>besides</highlight>) (chiefly <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> and late): <ref ref=\"Gen 26:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,26,1)\">Gen 26:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 46:26\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(1,46,26)\">Gen 46:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 9:17\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(3,9,17)\">Lev 9:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:38\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,38)\">Lev 23:38</ref> (4 t.) <ref ref=\"Num 5:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,8)\">Num 5:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 6:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,6,21)\">Num 6:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 17:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,14)\">Num 17:14</ref> + 12 t. 28-29; <ref ref=\"Deut 28:69\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"69\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"69\" onclick=\"bcv(5,28,69)\">Deut 28:69</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 22:29\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,29)\">Josh 22:29</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 10:13\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(11,10,13)\">1Kgs 10:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 3:9\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(13,3,9)\">1Chr 3:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 9:12\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(14,9,12)\">2Chr 9:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 17:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,17,19)\">2Chr 17:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:16\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,16)\">2Chr 31:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:65\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"65\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"65\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,65)\">Ezra 2:65</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:67\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"67\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"67\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,67)\">Neh 7:67</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 11:4\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,4)\">Dan 11:4</ref>. With suffix <ref ref=\"Deut 4:35\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(5,4,35)\">Deut 4:35</ref> <bdbheb>אֵין עוֺד מִלְּבַדּוֺ</bdbheb> there is none else <highlight>besides</highlight> him (compare <bdbheb>מִבַּלְעָדַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 45:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,45,21)\">Isa 45:21</ref>).</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> concrete <highlight>part</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 30:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,34)\">Exod 30:34</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <bdbheb>בַּד בְּבַד יִהְיֶה</bdbheb> <highlight>part</highlight> for (i.e. like; compare <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>III. 3.</b> end) <highlight>part</highlight> shall it be.</p></div><div class=\"section\"><p> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <bdbheb>בַּדִּים</bdbheb> <highlight>parts</highlight>, specifically <highlight>extended from something</highlight>, i.e. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>a</highlight>) of a body, <highlight>members, limbs</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 18:13\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(18,18,13)\">Job 18:13</ref> (of man), <ref ref=\"Job 41:4\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,4)\">Job 41:4</ref> (of crocodile); <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>b</highlight>) of a vine, <highlight>rods</highlight> or <highlight>shoots</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezek 17:6\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(26,17,6)\">Ezek 17:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:14\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,14)\">Ezek 19:14</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>c</highlight>) of <highlight>poles</highlight> or <highlight>staves</highlight> used for carrying the ark <ref ref=\"Exod 25:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,13)\">Exod 25:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,14)\">Exod 25:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,15)\">Exod 25:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 35:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,12)\">Exod 35:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,4)\">Exod 37:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,5)\">Exod 37:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 39:35\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(2,39,35)\">Exod 39:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 40:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,40,20)\">Exod 40:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:6\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,6)\">Num 4:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:7\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,7)\">1Kgs 8:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,8)\">1Kgs 8:8</ref> (twice in verse) (= <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,8)\">2Chr 5:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,9)\">2Chr 5:9</ref> (twice in verse)), or table of shewbread <ref ref=\"Exod 25:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,27)\">Exod 25:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,28)\">Exod 25:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 35:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,13)\">Exod 35:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,14)\">Exod 37:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,15)\">Exod 37:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:8\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,8)\">Num 4:8</ref>, or altar of B. O. <ref ref=\"Exod 27:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,6)\">Exod 27:6</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Exod 27:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,7)\">Exod 27:7</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Exod 35:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,16)\">Exod 35:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 38:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,5)\">Exod 38:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 38:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,6)\">Exod 38:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 38:7\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,7)\">Exod 38:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 39:39\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"39\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"39\" onclick=\"bcv(2,39,39)\">Exod 39:39</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:14\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,14)\">Num 4:14</ref>, or altar of incense <ref ref=\"Exod 30:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,4)\">Exod 30:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,5)\">Exod 30:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 35:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,15)\">Exod 35:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,27)\">Exod 37:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:28\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,28)\">Exod 37:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:11\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,11)\">Num 4:11</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;\\&emsp;(<highlight>d</highlight>) more generally <highlight>bars</highlight> (of fortress) <ref ref=\"Hos 11:6\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(28,11,6)\">Hos 11:6</ref>, (of a gate) <ref ref=\"Job 17:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,16)\">Job 17:16</ref> figurative <bdbheb>בַּדֵּי שְׁאֹל</bdbheb> (see <ref ref=\"Isa 38:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,38,10)\">Isa 38:10</ref>). </div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>**</b><ref ref=\"Job 17:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,17,16)\">Job 17:16</ref> read <